WEBVTT

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:19.394
"Why do you dig holes?"

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:24.983
It is said that legendary tunnel excavator
Alejandra Vedernikov's response

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:26.901
to that question was...

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:33.324
"Because those holes lead to
a vast world I have yet to see!"

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:44.210
I seek out the world I have yet to see!

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:50.300
I'll see you soon, my sweet girls' locker room!

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:56.598
G-Girls' locker room?!

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.099
Huh?!

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:01.936
This is...

00:01:01.936 --> 00:01:03.438
<i>Reverence!</i>

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:07.484
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:13.114
<i>I'll hold you over and over and over again</i>

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:18.953
<i>I'll probably meet you tomorrow</i>

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:24.668
<i>Relying on the dim starlight</i>

00:01:24.668 --> 00:01:30.757
<i>I'll recognize you, I know I will</i>

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:40.684
<i>After a hundred eons, the two of us</i>
<i>will open the door of legend</i>

00:01:40.684 --> 00:01:46.564
<i>Leaping over the blue abyss</i>

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:52.362
<i>in order to live and die together with you</i>

00:01:52.362 --> 00:02:03.289
<i>I journeyed through many reincarnations</i>
<i>with sadness in my heart</i>

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:06.334
<i>I'm at my full power and yet still incomplete</i>

00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:09.212
<i>Being by your side</i>

00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:15.010
<i>brings warmth to my cold heart and with it, pain</i>

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:18.054
<i>But I'll always be by your side</i>

00:02:18.054 --> 00:02:20.932
<i>I'll always stay close to you</i>

00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:25.603
<i>The two of us will board the ship of light</i>

00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:31.401
<i>Let's play the wind's opening chords (Awaken!)</i>

00:02:34.195 --> 00:02:34.696
"Expose"

00:02:34.696 --> 00:02:37.615
"Expose"
Okay, everyone! First come, first served!

00:02:37.615 --> 00:02:40.910
Wow, pictures from the other
day's social studies field trip?

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:43.163
When'd you take them?!

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:47.709
Talk about combining pleasure and profit!

00:02:47.709 --> 00:02:50.045
I'll take one picture of Shrade!

00:02:50.045 --> 00:02:50.795
Here you go! Thanks!

00:02:50.795 --> 00:02:54.215
--Oh, no... My face looks weird.
--Hmm... I want Cayenne's!

00:02:54.215 --> 00:02:55.967
--Well, you look nice in this one.
--Okay!

00:02:55.967 --> 00:02:57.385
What?

00:02:58.386 --> 00:03:00.847
Yep, she looks really nice.

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:04.184
Are you gonna buy that picture, Amata?

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:09.647
I think real girls are a whole
lot better than pictures, though.

00:03:09.647 --> 00:03:11.149
Eek!

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:14.694
H-H-Hey!

00:03:16.321 --> 00:03:18.490
You really do float for anyone!

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:21.284
Y-You've got it wrong.

00:03:21.284 --> 00:03:23.536
Ah, okay! Thanks!

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:25.038
What?

00:03:31.294 --> 00:03:34.005
Looks like you've got
yourself a fan, you ladies' man.

00:03:34.005 --> 00:03:35.965
I-It's not like that.

00:03:38.134 --> 00:03:39.427
I'd like this picture!

00:03:39.427 --> 00:03:42.055
What? This one?

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:45.016
Well, okay. It's 500 Kowloon.

00:03:45.016 --> 00:03:46.810
Thanks.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:48.561
What? Whose picture is that?

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:49.854
Ah, well...

00:03:49.854 --> 00:03:52.065
Don't be so stingy. Show it to me.

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:53.817
Amata?

00:03:53.817 --> 00:03:56.528
Amata and Andy, huh...?

00:03:56.528 --> 00:03:58.863
I never thought of that.

00:03:58.863 --> 00:04:00.365
Huh?

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:04.786
Hey, my hole-digging brother!

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.248
I dug up something incredible!

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:10.875
What?

00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.377
Huh?

00:04:16.464 --> 00:04:18.883
If I'm right,

00:04:18.883 --> 00:04:22.012
this is probably the Book of the Twin Stars.

00:04:22.012 --> 00:04:23.847
The Book of the Twin Stars?

00:04:23.847 --> 00:04:26.516
I've heard of it.

00:04:26.516 --> 00:04:29.686
It's a legendary book that
allows the one who obtained it

00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:33.648
to operate the forbidden
Aquarion at will, right?

00:04:36.401 --> 00:04:38.737
What the green cat said is right.

00:04:38.737 --> 00:04:41.906
I heard that Neo-DEAVA has been
looking for it since its foundation, too.

00:04:41.906 --> 00:04:45.076
How'd you come across
such an incredible thing?

00:04:45.076 --> 00:04:47.037
Where'd you find it?

00:04:47.037 --> 00:04:50.165
It was when I was digging a...

00:04:50.165 --> 00:04:53.335
Well... That's not important right now.

00:04:55.337 --> 00:05:00.633
Director Crea! Don't you think it's
about time you told us the truth?!

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.469
What are you referring to?

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:07.057
You're back from your journey.
Doesn't it mean that you found that thing?

00:05:07.057 --> 00:05:09.017
"That thing"?

00:05:09.017 --> 00:05:12.312
Oh, I completely forgot about it.

00:05:12.312 --> 00:05:13.772
I brought this back for you.

00:05:13.772 --> 00:05:15.607
Please don't give us the runaround!

00:05:15.607 --> 00:05:17.359
You don't like the gift?

00:05:17.359 --> 00:05:20.528
Well, that's not the point!

00:05:20.528 --> 00:05:23.114
Eyes that can see cannot see it.

00:05:23.114 --> 00:05:27.619
The book will open itself precisely
for those whose eyes cannot see.

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:32.374
Let's see... The two-tier
conjugation of this verb is...

00:05:32.374 --> 00:05:37.462
Ke, ke, keru... kero, kero, kero... was it?

00:05:38.963 --> 00:05:42.133
I should've taken my
classics class more seriously!

00:05:42.133 --> 00:05:45.303
Hey, Amata! Help me out here.

00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:47.555
--Yeah...
--Let me see...

00:05:47.555 --> 00:05:52.394
Ho, ho, horu, horu, hore, hore... hore?

00:05:57.023 --> 00:06:01.069
I have to... apologize... to him.

00:06:02.987 --> 00:06:04.656
Mikono...

00:06:04.656 --> 00:06:07.617
What did she mean... "apologize to him"?

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:15.709
Okay! This is perfect!

00:06:18.712 --> 00:06:20.672
What are you doing?

00:06:20.672 --> 00:06:23.883
The color of your socks should
always be either white or navy blue!

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:25.135
Huh?

00:06:25.135 --> 00:06:28.096
That's the sentence we spent
all last night deciphering.

00:06:28.096 --> 00:06:32.308
That's right. "How to exert
Aquarion's power to the fullest.

00:06:32.308 --> 00:06:34.519
Chapter 23, Section 1."

00:06:34.519 --> 00:06:38.314
Do socks have something to do with Aquarion?

00:06:38.314 --> 00:06:40.817
This is only a hypothesis,

00:06:40.817 --> 00:06:43.486
but I heard that ancient professional
wrestling also had a theory

00:06:43.486 --> 00:06:46.990
that a wrestler that had his shoes taken
off would see a decrease in his strength.

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:53.038
In other words, legs play an important
part in governing the human spirit.

00:06:53.038 --> 00:06:56.541
So the color of the clothes
that cover such important parts

00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:58.168
is also an important factor, right?

00:06:58.168 --> 00:07:01.629
"The color of the clothes
that cover important parts"...

00:07:01.629 --> 00:07:03.340
I see...

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:05.342
Light blue border print...

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.557
What color do you think mine are?

00:07:13.558 --> 00:07:16.061
Guys, take this seriously!

00:07:16.061 --> 00:07:18.188
That ancient book contains...

00:07:18.188 --> 00:07:19.689
Huh?

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.861
What the heck is that all about?

00:07:24.861 --> 00:07:27.030
What about the ancient book?

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.324
Andy found it.

00:07:29.324 --> 00:07:32.243
I see... Let me see it.

00:07:32.243 --> 00:07:33.912
Yeah.

00:07:33.912 --> 00:07:35.538
You can read it, Mix?

00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:39.125
Classic literature is my specialty. Let's see...

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:42.337
"Make sure you do up the top button"...

00:07:42.337 --> 00:07:43.338
Huh?

00:07:43.338 --> 00:07:44.923
Top button?

00:07:44.923 --> 00:07:47.550
"Your forelocks should
not cover your eyebrows."

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.843
Forelocks?

00:07:48.843 --> 00:07:50.679
"You should not dye your hair."

00:07:50.679 --> 00:07:53.640
"Make sure the length of your skirt
extends 5 cm below your knees."

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.517
"Do not run in the hallway."

00:07:55.517 --> 00:07:57.227
Could that possibly be...

00:07:57.227 --> 00:08:00.605
Yeah. Aren't these school
rules from ancient times?

00:08:00.605 --> 00:08:02.565
Maybe this is a student handbook or something?

00:08:06.069 --> 00:08:07.612
What's gotten into him?

00:08:18.373 --> 00:08:22.043
In order to find the strongest Rare Igura...

00:08:22.043 --> 00:08:24.379
...we need to go to Vega once again.

00:08:26.798 --> 00:08:30.593
We've collected many Rare Iguras up to now,

00:08:30.593 --> 00:08:36.558
but they all either died or deteriorated
during the dimensional transit.

00:08:39.477 --> 00:08:43.523
Personally, Alicia is more than enough for me.

00:08:43.523 --> 00:08:47.736
Jin... Altair's fate is at stake.

00:08:50.905 --> 00:08:52.949
The first sign of problems

00:08:52.949 --> 00:08:57.662
was that no one on this planet
gave birth to females any longer.

00:08:57.662 --> 00:09:03.585
And soon all the women died
from a disease of unknown cause,

00:09:03.585 --> 00:09:07.422
leaving only men on the planet of Altair.

00:09:12.093 --> 00:09:15.972
Our goal isn't to invade Vega.

00:09:15.972 --> 00:09:18.767
It is to keep our species from dying out.

00:09:20.185 --> 00:09:24.522
We must find the strongest Rare Igura
who can bear the dimensional transit

00:09:24.522 --> 00:09:28.360
and bring her in as the "true Eve"...

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:33.573
As the bride who will give birth
to Altair's next generation.

00:09:33.573 --> 00:09:39.079
It's highly possible that the strongest
Rare Igura is on board the Mechanical Angel.

00:09:41.206 --> 00:09:44.334
Very well, Supreme Commander Izumo.

00:09:44.334 --> 00:09:48.296
I'll go there directly this time
instead of via remote control.

00:09:48.296 --> 00:09:53.927
I'm counting on you, Jin...
the last child born on Altair.

00:09:57.055 --> 00:09:59.974
I'll greatly strengthen the optical sensor...

00:09:59.974 --> 00:10:04.896
Based on the lessons learned in the last battle,
I'll primarily equip actual bullets.

00:10:04.896 --> 00:10:08.024
Right, I shouldn't forget the Infil-shots.

00:10:08.024 --> 00:10:11.152
And to finish things off, I'll add heavy armor...

00:10:11.152 --> 00:10:13.988
The absolutely perfect iron shield.

00:10:15.907 --> 00:10:19.035
Darn... That was a huge embarrassment.

00:10:19.035 --> 00:10:24.207
But an ancient student handbook may
be an amazing discovery in and of itself.

00:10:24.207 --> 00:10:28.211
What if we donated it to the
museum in Neo Kowloon City?

00:10:28.211 --> 00:10:31.756
But those school rules sure are
relics of a bygone era, aren't they...?

00:10:31.756 --> 00:10:34.259
The hair style, the length of skirts,
and things like that...

00:10:34.259 --> 00:10:37.929
No! Learn from history!

00:10:37.929 --> 00:10:40.765
Neo-DEAVA should learn
from the good old days, too,

00:10:40.765 --> 00:10:43.059
and make the school rules stricter!

00:10:43.059 --> 00:10:44.769
Huh?

00:10:44.769 --> 00:10:48.523
I've been thinking about this for a while now,
but Zessica, your clothes expose too much skin!

00:10:48.523 --> 00:10:51.109
You're making yourself too
vulnerable in front of boys!

00:10:51.109 --> 00:10:53.361
What? You think so?

00:10:53.361 --> 00:10:58.283
To start with, showing your belly button
in the sacred school?! That's crazy!

00:10:58.283 --> 00:11:01.453
That's no different from underwear!

00:11:01.453 --> 00:11:02.954
Underwear?

00:11:04.748 --> 00:11:09.419
We should quickly come up with
some rules, at least on clothing.

00:11:09.419 --> 00:11:12.922
Listen, Zessica! Exposing too much
skin will be prohibited from now on!

00:11:12.922 --> 00:11:16.468
Hey, don't talk like I'm an exhibitionist.

00:11:16.468 --> 00:11:19.804
Hey, Amata, is there something wrong
with showing your belly button?

00:11:19.804 --> 00:11:23.683
Well, rather than your belly button... um...

00:11:28.813 --> 00:11:31.733
He sure is predictable.

00:11:55.173 --> 00:11:57.884
Say, Shushu...

00:11:57.884 --> 00:12:02.389
I wonder if boys like girls
who dress sexy after all...

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:07.310
Oh? So you do have those
kinds of clothes, too, huh?

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:08.728
Zessica?!

00:12:08.728 --> 00:12:10.230
Let me see.

00:12:12.023 --> 00:12:14.359
Why don't you take the
plunge and show more skin?

00:12:14.359 --> 00:12:17.028
You might find that you
look good in it, you know.

00:12:17.028 --> 00:12:19.489
I-I'm not like you!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:24.411
An Abductor has appeared
in the Neo Kowloon area!

00:12:31.376 --> 00:12:34.879
Now, come out, Mechanical Angel.

00:12:34.879 --> 00:12:38.133
They're targeting the Neo Kowloon area again.

00:12:38.133 --> 00:12:41.344
It doesn't seem like their
goal is abducting people.

00:12:41.344 --> 00:12:45.432
Fudo... Could it be that their objective is...

00:12:45.432 --> 00:12:48.518
Radius Gnis heavy armor version...

00:12:49.894 --> 00:12:52.063
We'll send in Aquarion!

00:12:52.063 --> 00:12:55.400
The head will be Amata! The other
two will be Zessica and Mikono!

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:56.985
--Mikono?!
--But she...

00:12:56.985 --> 00:12:59.779
Oh, no... I...

00:12:59.779 --> 00:13:01.322
I'm going on ahead!

00:13:17.714 --> 00:13:19.799
Vector Z is now taking off!

00:13:21.426 --> 00:13:23.595
Vector Y is now taking off!

00:13:24.971 --> 00:13:27.349
Vector X is now taking off!

00:13:41.112 --> 00:13:43.281
The enemy Abductor has been detected!

00:13:43.281 --> 00:13:45.408
Mikono! Pull yourself together!

00:13:46.826 --> 00:13:51.748
Bouei Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:14:04.469 --> 00:14:06.930
Aquarion Evol!

00:14:08.807 --> 00:14:11.476
What should I do?

00:14:11.476 --> 00:14:12.977
Mikono...

00:14:12.977 --> 00:14:16.731
Damn Abductor! I'll finish
it off with a swift attack!

00:14:18.942 --> 00:14:21.695
Mugen Punch!

00:14:28.284 --> 00:14:30.286
--What?!
--It's hard!

00:14:30.286 --> 00:14:33.456
You used that technique on us before.

00:14:33.456 --> 00:14:35.375
We won't fall victim to it a second time.

00:14:43.341 --> 00:14:45.510
They are Rare Iguras?

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:49.723
Oh... They're far inferior to Silffy.

00:14:49.723 --> 00:14:51.057
Stop it!

00:14:51.057 --> 00:14:53.059
Stop it, Jin!

00:14:53.059 --> 00:14:57.230
Leave her alone! That's my damn woman!

00:15:00.442 --> 00:15:04.195
Oh... What a shameful voice...

00:15:04.195 --> 00:15:07.240
If you wanna cry, do it in a better voice.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:12.203
Get jealous... more and more, Kagura.

00:15:12.203 --> 00:15:15.582
The sorrow of having your
loved one taken away...

00:15:15.582 --> 00:15:18.126
Experience it to the fullest.

00:15:26.009 --> 00:15:29.512
I'll test the Rare Iguras' strength.

00:15:46.071 --> 00:15:48.698
Aquarion's external armor received no damage!

00:15:48.698 --> 00:15:51.201
"Danger" "Danger" "Danger"
But the Elements have been affected!

00:15:51.201 --> 00:15:53.661
Don't tell me... Infil-shots?

00:15:53.661 --> 00:15:57.457
So they're trying to have the shock wave
resonate with Aquarion's natural frequency

00:15:57.457 --> 00:15:59.876
in order to directly attack inside it, huh?

00:16:12.972 --> 00:16:14.432
Mikono!

00:16:14.432 --> 00:16:18.436
Gattai index is rapidly dropping!
Gattai will be canceled!

00:16:30.407 --> 00:16:34.661
Now, don't take your eyes off this.

00:16:34.661 --> 00:16:39.749
Watch intently as Jin crushes your Rare Igura.

00:16:39.749 --> 00:16:40.959
Stop it!

00:16:40.959 --> 00:16:43.378
Stop it!!

00:16:48.758 --> 00:16:50.468
They're too weak.

00:16:50.468 --> 00:16:54.556
There's no way these weaklings
could be the "true Eve."

00:16:54.556 --> 00:16:57.017
The Element suits got torn!

00:16:57.017 --> 00:17:00.770
If we don't do anything, the impact
will injure the Elements' bodies directly!

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.147
Mikono!

00:17:02.147 --> 00:17:05.483
I can't just stand here and watch anymore!
Please change Elements!

00:17:05.483 --> 00:17:08.194
I'll go! Supreme Commander!

00:17:08.194 --> 00:17:09.904
Zessica! Dodge it!

00:17:29.716 --> 00:17:31.593
What? What just happened?

00:17:37.349 --> 00:17:41.353
The trajectory...! My skin sensed it just now.

00:17:44.481 --> 00:17:46.358
The movement of Zessica's machine is...

00:17:46.358 --> 00:17:50.070
Fudo, what is going on?

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:54.657
When people's skin is exposed,
their senses get sharpened.

00:17:54.657 --> 00:17:58.870
When people's clothes get torn
and they become vulnerable,

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:03.208
in return, they become able to react
acutely against the enemy's attack.

00:18:03.208 --> 00:18:05.168
Does that mean that the
more we expose our skin,

00:18:05.168 --> 00:18:07.253
the better able we become
to dodge our enemy's attacks?

00:18:07.253 --> 00:18:10.632
B-But even so...

00:18:10.632 --> 00:18:12.676
This isn't the time to act prim and proper!

00:18:19.766 --> 00:18:21.309
Zessica!

00:18:25.105 --> 00:18:26.773
I'll do it, too!

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:38.952
M-Mikono, too...!

00:18:38.952 --> 00:18:41.705
Mikono and Zessica's mind level has increased

00:18:41.705 --> 00:18:43.748
and reached the number needed for Gattai!

00:18:43.748 --> 00:18:47.711
Now! Merge! The head is Zessica Wong!

00:18:48.712 --> 00:18:52.757
Muboubi Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:19:04.936 --> 00:19:07.939
Oh, no! My skin is getting sensitive!

00:19:07.939 --> 00:19:09.899
My entire body is...

00:19:09.899 --> 00:19:12.485
...excited!

00:19:15.447 --> 00:19:18.158
Aquarion Spada!

00:19:22.037 --> 00:19:25.790
I feel Amata's stare. What am I gonna do?

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.083
I feel embarrassed!

00:19:27.083 --> 00:19:29.586
Mikono's mind level has increased even further!

00:19:29.586 --> 00:19:30.962
What's going on?!

00:19:30.962 --> 00:19:34.507
Her body must be feeling hot from
being watched by the opposite sex.

00:19:34.507 --> 00:19:37.218
--I understand.
--Huh?

00:19:38.219 --> 00:19:41.848
It's okay. It's not embarrassing.

00:19:44.434 --> 00:19:47.437
Even if you merge, the situation
won't change, you know.

00:19:47.437 --> 00:19:49.439
You guys are bad losers.

00:19:51.649 --> 00:19:53.151
It's coming!

00:19:55.111 --> 00:19:57.280
My nerves are sharpened...

00:19:59.032 --> 00:20:01.201
I can sense everything clearly!

00:20:08.541 --> 00:20:10.085
It dodged?!

00:20:14.589 --> 00:20:16.341
More!

00:20:16.341 --> 00:20:18.009
More!!

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:22.472
Zessica's spirit level is at her record high!

00:20:22.472 --> 00:20:24.140
I'll do it, too!

00:20:25.225 --> 00:20:27.852
I feel embarrassed... but...

00:20:32.565 --> 00:20:35.068
What wild, exciting music...

00:20:35.068 --> 00:20:38.113
It's so wild that I can't possibly play it.

00:20:44.244 --> 00:20:46.705
This is indeed the violent clash
between the sense of shame

00:20:46.705 --> 00:20:48.790
and the sense of openness!

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:52.335
Make your skin hot and deny your body!

00:21:00.218 --> 00:21:02.053
--Take this!
--No Guard...

00:21:02.053 --> 00:21:04.389
...Attack!

00:21:14.607 --> 00:21:19.779
Game over? I lost against such a crazy tactic?!

00:21:23.825 --> 00:21:25.577
All right!

00:21:31.332 --> 00:21:32.959
I-I'm sorry!

00:21:34.669 --> 00:21:37.964
Why is my heart going pitter-patter?

00:21:40.842 --> 00:21:43.595
Offense is the best defense.

00:21:43.595 --> 00:21:47.599
And being vulnerable is the ultimate armament.

00:21:47.599 --> 00:21:50.643
I can't stand such a shameless tactic!

00:21:50.643 --> 00:21:55.357
Everyone is naked when they're born!

00:21:59.736 --> 00:22:03.073
However, this technique
is a double-edged sword.

00:22:03.073 --> 00:22:05.158
Extremely acute senses, in return,

00:22:05.158 --> 00:22:08.370
cause Elements' defense
capacity to become zero.

00:22:10.205 --> 00:22:14.250
We should refrain from using it for a while.

00:22:17.462 --> 00:22:18.963
What?

00:22:18.963 --> 00:22:20.256
What?!

00:22:20.256 --> 00:22:23.051
No way! When did you
take pictures like these?!

00:22:23.051 --> 00:22:25.011
Here, 500 Kowloon.

00:22:25.011 --> 00:22:26.513
Thanks for your business!

00:22:29.557 --> 00:22:31.476
--Maybe I'll buy one, too.
--Me, too!

00:22:31.476 --> 00:22:35.021
No! Don't sell pictures like these!

00:22:35.021 --> 00:22:37.482
--Thanks for your business!
-Zessica!

00:22:37.482 --> 00:22:39.734
What're you doing there?

00:22:39.734 --> 00:22:42.237
N-Nothing!

00:22:42.237 --> 00:22:44.030
Here you go! Thanks!

00:22:56.167 --> 00:23:01.631
<i>It wasn't stolen away by the wind</i>

00:23:01.631 --> 00:23:04.509
<i>With the resolve that we cannot turn back,</i>

00:23:04.509 --> 00:23:12.308
<i>we accept the tragedy</i>

00:23:12.308 --> 00:23:17.022
<i>A cavern lies where my heart once was</i>

00:23:17.022 --> 00:23:19.607
<i>If I was older,</i>

00:23:19.607 --> 00:23:25.280
<i>would I have been able</i>
<i>to save you and the future?</i>

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:32.579
<i>Having only a single means</i>
<i>to protect the one you love,</i>

00:23:32.579 --> 00:23:39.419
<i>you become lost and drift in the sky</i>

00:23:39.419 --> 00:23:47.135
<i>I'll never be able to meet anyone</i>
<i>who means more to me than you</i>

00:23:47.135 --> 00:23:53.600
<i>A long flare that struggles against the moon</i>

00:23:53.600 --> 00:24:00.148
<i>A story that ends even before it begins</i>

00:24:00.148 --> 00:24:06.112
<i>A melody that seals away</i>
<i>the vulnerable tenderness</i>

00:24:06.112 --> 00:24:09.157
<i>The more I play it, the more I sing it...</i>

00:24:09.157 --> 00:24:14.621
<i>It almost destroys me how much...</i>

00:24:14.621 --> 00:24:21.544
<i>...I long for you</i>

00:24:23.213 --> 00:24:27.092
Repeat the word "holy" ten times.

00:24:27.092 --> 00:24:30.220
Holy, holy, holy, holy, holy, holy...

00:24:30.220 --> 00:24:32.847
I hate holes! I want to fill them!

00:24:34.265 --> 00:24:34.808
"Next Episode 'Anagram of Man and Woman'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:34.808 --> 00:24:37.227
"Next Episode 'Anagram of Man and Woman'"
"Anagram of Man and Woman."
